  "keyPoints": {
    "en": [
      "In Fusion mode, Tetris pieces clear rows but also count as chain material for Puyo chains—position Tetris pieces to activate Puyo chains simultaneously for maximum simultaneous clear output.",
      "Tetris T-Spin Triple (TST) provides the highest-value Tetris clear per piece (equivalent to 6 lines sent)—mastering the TST opener within the first 3 pieces of any board is the highest-impact Tetris skill.",
      "Puyo chain building: always build main chains from the bottom with anchor colours and branch colours extending upward—building a 4-chain from the top down rather than bottom up is harder to extend and more vulnerable to garbage interruption.",
      "Garbage Blocks in Fusion mode take 3 Puyo or 1 full Tetris line to clear—prioritise clearing garbage on the Tetris side if it approaches the 10th column height, as Tetris garbage is more disruptive to chain structure than Puyo garbage.",
      "Skill Battle mode charges Skills faster when you keep combo chains high—the Skill meter charges at 2× speed during a chain combo of 3 or longer, making chain play doubly rewarding in Skill Battle."
    ],
    "ja": [
      "フュージョンモードでは、テトリスのピースは行をクリアしつつぷよの連鎖素材にもなる。テトリスのピースをぷよの連鎖を同時に発動させる位置に配置して最大の同時クリア出力を得る。",
      "テトリスのTスピントリプル（TST）は1ピースあたり最高価値のクリア（6ライン送りに相当）を提供する。最初の3ピース以内にTSTオープナーをマスターすることが最も影響が大きいテトリスのスキル。",
      "ぷよの連鎖構築：アンカーの色を底部から配置し、ブランチ色を上に伸ばす。上から下へ4連鎖を構築するよりボトムアップの方が延長しやすく、ゴミの割り込みに強い。",
      "フュージョンモードのゴミブロックはぷよ3個か完全なテトリス1ラインでクリアする。ゴミが10列目の高さに近づいたらテトリス側を優先してクリアする。テトリスのゴミはぷよのゴミより連鎖構造に対して破壊的。",
      "スキルバトルモードはコンボ連鎖を高く保つほどスキルが早くチャージされる。スキルメーターは3以上の連鎖コンボ中に2倍速でチャージされ、スキルバトルで連鎖プレイを2重に価値ある。"
    ]
  },
  "opening": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Mode Selection for Skill Development",
        "body": "Puyo Puyo Tetris 2 offers three primary competitive modes: Puyo vs. Puyo, Tetris vs. Tetris, and Fusion (hybrid). Start with whichever base game (Puyo or Tetris) you have more experience with and reach intermediate in that mode before attempting Fusion. Fusion requires simultaneous management of both game types and overwhelms players who lack fluency in either. The Skill Battle mode is the recommended entry point for beginners as it provides extra tools (skills and items) that compensate for technical gaps."
      },
      {
        "title": "Garbage Counter Recognition",
        "body": "Each game type has different garbage counter systems. In Puyo: opponent chains send rows of grey blocks that interrupt your field. Small chains (2–3 combos) send 1–2 rows; large chains (6+) can send 10+ rows. In Tetris: T-Spins and Tetris clears send additional lines to the opponent's field. The earliest competitive skill to develop is reading the opponent's threat level from their garbage counter number displayed on screen and adjusting your clearing priority before their attack lands."
      }
    ]
  },
  "midGame": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Puyo Chain Repair After Garbage",
        "body": "Receiving garbage (grey blocks) mid-chain forces a rebuild. The repair technique: identify the largest intact section of your pre-garbage chain, anchor new Puyos to that section first, and rebuild the remainder. Most players make the mistake of clearing garbage immediately when it arrives rather than working around it—only clear garbage that directly blocks your planned chain path, not all garbage simultaneously. Partial repair while maintaining chain depth often outperforms full garbage clear then rebuild."
      },
      {
        "title": "Skill Battle Item Economy",
        "body": "Skills in Skill Battle mode have varying charge times and effects. Offensive skills (Puyo Barrage, Tetris All Clear) pair best with characters who have fast skill charge rates (Sig, Arle). Defensive skills (Garbage Cancel, Heal) suit characters entering a defensive position. Never use two offensive skills simultaneously against the same opponent—stagger them 3–5 turns apart to maintain constant pressure rather than one overwhelming burst followed by a long recovery."
      }
    ]
  },
  "endGame": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Advanced Fusion Technique",
        "body": "Mastering Fusion requires the \"Tetri-chain\" technique: place a Tetris piece in a configuration that simultaneously completes a row (Tetris clear) and triggers a Puyo chain pop (chain clear). The Tetris clear fires first, then the Puyo chain activates one frame later—both send garbage simultaneously, creating an unreactable double garbage wave. This technique requires intentional board state setup: keep a 3-colour Puyo chain at level 4 readiness while maintaining a live Tetris board in the upper field."
      }
    ]
  },
  "mistakes": {
    "en": [
      "Stacking Puyo chains too high before activating—chains above the 11th row are unreliable and garbage can completely bury them; fire chains at 6-combo depth maximum to maintain response speed.",
      "Ignoring the \"all clear\" bonus in Tetris mode—clearing all pieces from the board adds a massive bonus garbage send; set up all-clear traps in the early game when the board is sparse.",
      "Using defensive Skills speculatively when not under pressure—Skills recharge slowly; using a defensive Skill against minor garbage wastes the resource for a critical garbage wave.",
      "Not adapting Tetris piece placement to Puyo chain positioning in Fusion—every Tetris piece placed should consider whether it enables or disrupts the current Puyo chain structure; random Tetris placement in Fusion mode is heavily punished.",
      "Panicking on garbage arrival and clearing everything immediately—quick single-line clears in Tetris mode send less garbage than a T-Spin; if garbage arrives, assess whether a planned T-Spin finishes before the garbage settles before defaulting to panic clears."
    ],
    "ja": [
      "ぷよの連鎖を発火前に高く積みすぎる。11行目より上の連鎖は信頼性が低く、ゴミが完全に埋める可能性がある。応答速度を保つため最大6コンボの深さで連鎖を発火する。",
      "テトリスモードでオールクリアボーナスを無視する。フィールドからすべてのピースをクリアすると大量のゴミ送りボーナスが加わる。フィールドが少ない序盤にオールクリアトラップを設定する。",
      "プレッシャー下にない時に憶測で防御スキルを使う。スキルの再チャージは遅い。少量のゴミに防御スキルを使うと、重大なゴミウェーブのための資源が無駄になる。",
      "フュージョンでテトリスのピース配置をぷよの連鎖配置に適応させない。配置される全テトリスのピースは、現在のぷよ連鎖構造を有効にするか妨害するかを考慮すべき。フュージョンモードでのランダムなテトリス配置は重く罰せられる。",
      "ゴミ到着時にパニックになって全てを即座にクリアする。テトリスモードのクイックシングルラインクリアはTスピンより少ないゴミを送る。ゴミが届いた場合、デフォルトのパニッククリアに戻る前に計画されたTスピンがゴミが落ち着く前に終わるかどうかを評価する。"
